(7603271, 1228289, 104230, '<td valign="top">Wait a minute ... that''s unreal (the something else you mentioned, that is).  How much of it is due to the hand of man?  Fascinating capture. Love the tones.<br/> <br/>ETA: Congratulations. I got so carried away by what I was seeing that I forgot to say that !! <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-11-19 13:58:43.</i></td>', 'Wait a minute ... that''s unreal (the something else you mentioned, that is).  How much of it is due to the hand of man?  Fascinating capture. Love the tones. ETA: Congratulations. I got so carried away by what I was seeing that I forgot to say that !! ', '2018-11-19 00:16:45.000000', '2018-11-19 13:58:43.000000', 0),
