(7603301, 1228289, 20608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by PennyClick:</b></div><hr/><i> Wait a minute ... that''s unreal (the something else you mentioned, that is).  How much of it is due to the hand of man?  Fascinating capture. Love the tones. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s an old Quarry in the Lake District so, yes it is man made, did they design a skull image? I very much doubt it otherwise I have to commend the explosives expert for his artistic streak :)<br/> <br/>The place is called Hodge Close, it''s a bit of a climb to get down there but when I saw the Skull, it blew my mind (pun intended).<br/> <br/>Thank you for your interest.</td>', 'Originally posted by PennyClick: Wait a minute ... that''s unreal (the something else you mentioned, that is).  How much of it is due to the hand of man?  Fascinating capture. Love the tones.   It''s an old Quarry in the Lake District so, yes it is man made, did they design a skull image? I very much doubt it otherwise I have to commend the explosives expert for his artistic streak :) The place is called Hodge Close, it''s a bit of a climb to get down there but when I saw the Skull, it blew my mind (pun intended). Thank you for your interest.', '2018-11-19 04:04:42.000000', NULL, 0),
