(7603355, 1228289, 93872, '<td valign="top">Congrats on this one!  I admit I didn''t see the something else until after the challenge finished.  Did you consider posting it in the vertical orientation?</td>', 'Congrats on this one!  I admit I didn''t see the something else until after the challenge finished.  Did you consider posting it in the vertical orientation?', '2018-11-19 12:58:26.000000', NULL, 0),
